  "worked_solution": "To raise the fraction to the power of $9$, we must raise both the numerator and the denominator to the power of $9:$\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{5}{8})}^{9}=\\frac{{5}^{9}}{{8}^{9}}\n$$",
